      "message": "I am not sure this is the right way to fix the issue.\nThe `core.userPerRequestRefCache` implements a snapshotting mechanism on packed-refs, which is automatically redundant when using reftable as the format for the ref-db.\n\nI believe the correct fix is to automatically disable the flag in the `LocalDiskRepositoryManager` if the underlying repository format is reftable.\n\nThe proposed fix has two advantages:\n\n1. Simplify the code and the UX: from v3.15 onwards, you can always choose the reftable format if you want\n2. Allow you to still use snapshotting on `files`-based ref-directory on some repositories and `reftable` on others",
